#: .\landing\templates\landing\index.html:3017
msgid ""
"\n"
"          Mexican-American players will have the opportunity to join the "
"new\n"
"          <strong>#Estado33 team</strong> — officially recognized by the\n"
"          <strong>FEMEBE (Mexican Baseball Federation)</strong> — to "
"compete\n"
"          alongside the other states in the upcoming <strong>11–12 Age "
"Division\n"
"          National Baseball Championship</strong> in La Paz, Baja California "
"Sur.\n"
"          "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"          Los jugadores mexicoamericanos tendrán la oportunidad de formar "
"parte del nuevo\n"
"          equipo <strong>#Estado33</strong> — reconocido oficialmente por "
"la\n"
"          <strong>FEMEBE (Federación Mexicana de Béisbol)</strong> — para "
"participar\n"
"          junto a los demás estados en el próximo <strong>Campeonato "
"Nacional de\n"
"          Béisbol División 11-12</strong> en La Paz, Baja California Sur.\n"
"          "

#: .\landing\templates\landing\index.html:3026
msgid ""
"\n"
"          The top dual-national players will face off against the best "
"players\n"
"          from across Mexico, competing for a spot on the\n"
"          <strong>Mexican National Team</strong> that will participate in "
"the\n"
"          <strong>12U Pan American Games</strong>.\n"
"          "
msgstr ""
"\n"
